<% content_for :title, "Data Deletion" %>
<div class="page-head">
  <h1>Data Deletion Instructions</h1>
  <p class="muted">Army KlangTECH</p>
</div>

<div class="card" style="max-width:820px; line-height:1.7;">
  <p>You can delete the data Army KlangTECH holds about you at any time:</p>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Disconnect your Page</strong> — go to the Connections page in Army KlangTECH and remove the connected Page. This revokes our access token and stops any further data collection.</li>
    <li><strong>Revoke from Facebook</strong> — remove Army KlangTECH under <a href="https://www.facebook.com/settings?tab=business_tools" style="color:var(--primary-color);">Settings → Business Integrations</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Request full deletion</strong> — email <strong>kunkundids@gmail.com</strong> with the Page name or ID. We will delete all associated conversation and profile data within 30 days and confirm by reply.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="muted">This page also serves as the Data Deletion Instructions URL for Meta App Review.</p>
</div>
